Purpose
Recover read-only current universal provenance for a generated winner already promoted by the specialized ProfileChallengeService after an application restart, without reconstructing an unpersisted ProfileChallengeResult and without adding promotion, validation, winner, mutation or persistence authority.

Durable specialized basis
ProfileChallengeService already appends a Profile HistoryEvent after successful specialized promotion. DetailsJson records challengerProfileId, previousWinnerId, promotedProfileId, revalidationComparisonId and targetKind. Slice 11 treats this event only as a durable receipt/correlation record.

